strophic failure, the absence of a clear locus of responsibility renders institutional accountability impossible to enforce. We must treat oversight as a mandatory safeguard, consistent with existing frameworks like the NIST AI Risk Management Framework, which emphasizes the necessity of human control in high-stakes environments. \"Infrastructure requires human political deliberation to ensure systemic stability,\" because only humans can be held responsible when the system fails to protect the public interest.",
